{
  "apiVersion": "yingce.plugin/v2",
  "id": "dacheng-relay",
  "name": "大橙中转（WAN 3.0 / Seedance 2.5）",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "author": "影策",
  "description": "大橙中转站 /api/open/v1 异步视频协议：提交任务后用任务 ID 回查状态与成片地址。",
  "documentation": "# 大橙中转（263281.xyz）\n\n对接大橙开放 API 的异步视频任务：`POST /api/open/v1/videos` 提交，`GET /api/open/v1/videos/{taskId}` 回查，成功后取 `video_url`。\n\n## 协议身份\n\n- 插件 ID：`dacheng-relay`\n- 能力：`video`\n- 默认 Base URL：`https://263281.xyz`\n- 鉴权：`Authorization: Bearer <API Key>`\n\n## 接口\n\n- 创建：`POST /api/open/v1/videos`（JSON）\n- 查询：`GET /api/open/v1/videos/{taskId}`\n- 目录：`GET /api/open/v1/models`（仅用于核对上游模型与价格，不进协议）\n\n## 参数映射\n\n| 画布字段 | 上游字段 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `model` | `modelKey` | 渠道模型的 providerModelKey，如 `wan3-0` / `seedance-2-5` |\n| `prompt` | `prompt` | 提示词 |\n| `duration` | `duration` | 秒数；未指定默认 10 |\n| `aspectRatio` | `ratio` | 16:9 / 9:16 / 1:1 / 4:3 / 3:4 / adaptive |\n| `resolution` | `resolution` | 480P / 720P / 1080P（Seedance 2.5 仅 720P） |\n| `generateAudio` | `audio` | 是否生成对白与音效 |\n| 参考图 | `images[]` | 公网可访问 URL |\n| 参考音频 | `audios[]` | 公网可访问 URL |\n| 参考视频 | `videos[]` | 公网可访问 URL |\n| `mode` | `mode` | reference / first / ends，默认 reference |\n\n## 上游计费\n\n- `wan3-0`：¥2.00/条，与时长分辨率无关。\n- `seedance-2-5`：¥6.00/条（720P）。\n\n## 出片耗时\n\n万相约 1~2 小时，最长 3 小时；插件声明了 `detachedPolling`，提交后释放执行位，由调度回查。\n",
  "permissions": [
    "generation.run",
    "media.read"
  ],
  "configuration": {
    "fields": [
      {
        "name": "apiKey",
        "type": "secret",
        "label": "API Key",
        "placeholder": "dc-prod_...",
        "required": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "contributes": {
    "providers": [
      {
        "id": "dacheng-relay",
        "label": "大橙中转",
        "capabilities": [
          "video"
        ],
        "scopes": [
          "admin.system-channel",
          "canvas",
          "creation",
          "agent"
        ],
        "baseUrl": "https://263281.xyz",
        "detachedPolling": true,
        "requiresPublicMediaURLs": true,
        "auth": {
          "type": "bearer",
          "field": "apiKey"
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "prompt",
            "type": "string",
            "required": false,
            "mapping": "prompt",
            "description": "视频描述或编辑要求。"
          },
          {
            "name": "images",
            "type": "media[]",
            "required": false,
            "mapping": "images[]",
            "description": "参考图，必须是公网可访问的 URL。"
          },
          {
            "name": "videos",
            "type": "media[]",
            "required": false,
            "mapping": "videos[]",
            "description": "参考视频，必须是公网可访问的 URL。"
          },
          {
            "name": "audios",
            "type": "media[]",
            "required": false,
            "mapping": "audios[]",
            "description": "参考音频，必须是公网可访问的 URL。"
          },
          {
            "name": "duration",
            "type": "integer",
            "required": false,
            "mapping": "duration",
            "description": "成片秒数；万相 2-30 秒，Seedance 2.5 为 4-30 秒。"
          },
          {
            "name": "aspectRatio",
            "type": "string",
            "required": false,
            "mapping": "ratio",
            "values": [
              "16:9",
              "9:16",
              "1:1",
              "4:3",
              "3:4",
              "adaptive"
            ],
            "description": "画幅。"
          },
          {
            "name": "resolution",
            "type": "string",
            "required": false,
            "mapping": "resolution",
            "values": [
              "480P",
              "720P",
              "1080P"
            ],
            "description": "清晰度；Seedance 2.5 仅支持 720P。"
          },
          {
            "name": "generateAudio",
            "type": "boolean",
            "required": false,
            "mapping": "audio",
            "description": "是否同时生成对白与音效。"
          },
          {
            "name": "providerOptions",
            "type": "object",
            "required": false,
            "mapping": "mode",
            "description": "命名空间 dacheng-relay：mode（reference / first / ends）覆盖参考模式。"
          }
        ],
        "create": {
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/api/open/v1/videos",
          "originPath": true,
          "contentType": "application/json",
          "body": {
            "modelKey": {
              "$ref": "request.model"
            },
            "prompt": {
              "$omitEmpty": {
                "$ref": "request.prompt"
              }
            },
            "duration": {
              "$if": {
                "condition": {
                  "$gt": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "request.duration"
                    },
                    0
                  ]
                },
                "then": {
                  "$ref": "request.duration"
                },
                "else": 10
              }
            },
            "ratio": {
              "$omitEmpty": {
                "$ref": "request.aspectRatio"
              }
            },
            "resolution": {
              "$omitEmpty": {
                "$upper": {
                  "$ref": "request.resolution"
                }
              }
            },
            "audio": {
              "$coalesce": [
                {
                  "$ref": "request.generateAudio"
                },
                true
              ]
            },
            "mode": {
              "$coalesce": [
                {
                  "$ref": "request.providerOptions.dacheng-relay.mode"
                },
                "reference"
              ]
            },
            "images": {
              "$omitEmpty": {
                "$map": {
                  "from": {
                    "$sortByOrder": {
                      "$ref": "request.images"
                    }
                  },
                  "as": "media",
                  "in": {
                    "$ref": "media.value"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "videos": {
              "$omitEmpty": {
                "$map": {
                  "from": {
                    "$sortByOrder": {
                      "$ref": "request.videos"
                    }
                  },
                  "as": "media",
                  "in": {
                    "$ref": "media.value"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "audios": {
              "$omitEmpty": {
                "$map": {
                  "from": {
                    "$sortByOrder": {
                      "$ref": "request.audios"
                    }
                  },
                  "as": "media",
                  "in": {
                    "$ref": "media.value"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "poll": {
          "method": "GET",
          "path": "/api/open/v1/videos/{{taskId}}",
          "originPath": true
        },
        "response": {
          "taskId": {
            "$coalesce": [
              {
                "$ref": "response.id"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "response.task_id"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "taskId"
              }
            ]
          },
          "status": {
            "$switch": {
              "cases": [
                {
                  "when": {
                    "$eq": [
                      {
                        "$lower": {
                          "$coalesce": [
                            {
                              "$ref": "response.status"
                            },
                            ""
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      "succeeded"
                    ]
                  },
                  "then": "succeeded"
                },
                {
                  "when": {
                    "$eq": [
                      {
                        "$lower": {
                          "$coalesce": [
                            {
                              "$ref": "response.status"
                            },
                            ""
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      "failed"
                    ]
                  },
                  "then": "failed"
                },
                {
                  "when": {
                    "$eq": [
                      {
                        "$lower": {
                          "$coalesce": [
                            {
                              "$ref": "response.status"
                            },
                            ""
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      "cancelled"
                    ]
                  },
                  "then": "cancelled"
                },
                {
                  "when": {
                    "$in": [
                      {
                        "$lower": {
                          "$coalesce": [
                            {
                              "$ref": "response.status"
                            },
                            ""
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      [
                        "running",
                        "processing",
                        "generating",
                        "in_progress"
                      ]
                    ]
                  },
                  "then": "processing"
                },
                {
                  "when": {
                    "$in": [
                      {
                        "$lower": {
                          "$coalesce": [
                            {
                              "$ref": "response.status"
                            },
                            ""
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      [
                        "pending",
                        "queued",
                        "created",
                        "submitted"
                      ]
                    ]
                  },
                  "then": "pending"
                }
              ],
              "default": "pending"
            }
          },
          "message": {
            "$coalesce": [
              {
                "$ref": "response.error"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "response.message"
              }
            ]
          },
          "videos": {
            "$ref": "response.video_url"
          },
          "resultEphemeral": true
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
